## Immutability

Use spread operator for immutable updates:

```typescript
// WRONG: Mutation
function updateUser(user, name) {
  user.name = name  // MUTATION!
  return user
}

// CORRECT: Immutability
function updateUser(user, name) {
  return {
    ...user,
    name
  }
}
```

